---
import release from '../data/release.json';

const pending = release.sha256.includes('待') || release.sha256.trim().length !== 64;
---

<div class="card">
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4">
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500">当前版本</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">GeoViewer {release.version}</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-600">
        发布于 {release.date} · 需要 macOS {release.min_macos} 或更高版本
      </p>
    </div>
    <span class="badge-brand">DMG · 约 3 MB</span>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
    <a href={release.dmg} class="btn-primary">下载 GeoViewer {release.version}</a>
    <a href="https://github.com/graylogo/GeoViewer" class="btn-ghost" rel="noopener" target="_blank">
      查看源码
    </a>
  </div>

  <dl class="mt-8 grid gap-4 border-t border-neutral-100 pt-6 text-sm sm:grid-cols-2">
    <div>
      <dt class="text-neutral-500">校验值（SHA-256）</dt>
      <dd class="mt-1 break-all font-mono text-xs text-neutral-800">
        {pending ? '待构建后填入' : release.sha256}
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt class="text-neutral-500">校验方法</dt>
      <dd class="mt-1 font-mono text-xs text-neutral-800">shasum -a 256 GeoViewer-{release.version}.dmg</dd>
    </div>
  </dl>

  <p class="mt-6 rounded-xl bg-neutral-50 p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-neutral-600">
    应用目前为 ad-hoc 签名，未做公证。首次打开若被 Gatekeeper 拦截，请在访达中
    <span class="font-medium text-neutral-800">右键点击应用 → 打开</span>。
  </p>
</div>
